iew required' ?></span><span class="os-chip good"><?= number_format($metrics['legacy_mapped']??0) ?> / 757 legacy</span><span class="os-chip"><?= number_format($metrics['journals']??0) ?> journals</span><span class="os-chip"><?= number_format($metrics['cash_accounts']??0) ?> cash/bank accounts</span><span class="os-chip"><?= number_format($metrics['manual']??0) ?> manual entries</span></div></section><?php if($error):?><div class="pp-alert bad"><strong>Audit diagnostic:</strong> <?= f16h($error) ?></div><?php endif;?><section class="os-card" style="margin-top:14px"><div class="os-title-row"><div><h2>Completion Checks</h2><p>Zero finance transactions are valid when there is no real Sales/Purchase cash activity. No fake bank account or opening balance is required.</p></div><span class="pp-badge <?= $complete?'':'warn' ?>"><?= $passed ?> PASS / <?= $failed ?> REVIEW</span></div><div class="pp-audit-grid"><?php foreach($checks as $c):?><div class="pp-audit"><div><b><?= f16h($c['name']) ?></b><span><?= f16h($c['detail']) ?></span></div><strong class="<?= $c['ok']?'':'bad' ?>"><?= $c['ok']?'PASS':'REVIEW' ?></strong></div><?php endforeach;?></div></section><div class="os-footer-note"><strong>STEP 16 completion rule:</strong> accounting remains double-entry and source-traceable; unknown bank identity and tax classification are never guessed.</div></main></div></body></html>